<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP CHAMPIONS' LEAGUE COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of European Cup</p>
<p>Champions' League group matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Glasgow:</p>
<p>Glasgow Rangers (Scotland) 2 Grasshopper Zurich</p>
<p>(Switzerland) 1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Rangers - Ally McCoist 66 penalty, 72</p>
<p>Grasshopper - Jan Berger 76</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>In Amsterdam:</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam (Netherlands) 1 Auxerre (France) 2 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ajax - Tijani Babangida 44</p>
<p>Auxerre - Bernard Diomede 11, Steve Marlet 56</p>
<p>Attendance: 48,000</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Bucharest:</p>
<p>Steaua Bucharest (Romania) 1 Atletico Madrid  (Spain) 1</p>
<p>(0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Steaua - Sabin Ilie 51</p>
<p>Atletico - Milinko Pantic 23</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000</p>
<p>In Lodz:</p>
<p>Widzew Lodz (Poland) 2 Borussia Dortmund (Germany) 2 (2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Widzew - Jacek Dembinski 15, 19</p>
<p>Borussia - Paul Lambert 13, Juergen Kohler 62</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Manchester:</p>
<p>Juventus (Italy) 1 Manchester United (England) 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Alessandro del Piero 35 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 53,529</p>
<p>In Istanbul:</p>
<p>Fenerbahce (Turkey) 1 Rapid Vienna (Austria) 0 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer - Jes Hogh 75</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Oporto:</p>
<p>Porto (Portugal) 1 AC Milan (Italy) 1 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Porto: Edmilson Pimenta 70</p>
<p>AC Milan: Edgar Davids 55</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>In Trondheim::</p>
<p>Rosenborg BK (Norway) 1 IFK Gothenburg (Sweden) 0 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Bent Skammelsrud 66 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,000</p>
</text>
